  "description": "Single storey rear extension with widening of existing vehicular access.",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "In the absence of a suitable arboricultural impact assessment it has not been demonstrated that the proposal would not impact the street tree immediately outside of the site, adjacent to the crossover.  The loss of this tree, or any damage to the tree, would be unacceptable in terms of harm to biodiversity, the character and appearance of the Lakes Estate Conservation Area and the wider street tree programme of the London Borough of Enfield.  The proposal is therefore considered to be contrary to the advice contained within the NPPF (2024),  Policies HC1, G7 of the London Plan (2021), CP30, CP31, CP36 of the Core Poluicy (2010), DMD 44, DMD 46 and DMD 80 of the Development Management Document (2014)."
